---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="top-basic-design" id="basic-design">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section-top">
      <TitleLv2 title="成果につながる基本設計" />
      <div class="l-section-body-top">
        <p class="top-basic-design-lead">
          サイトごとに最適解は異なりますが、外さないための基本設計があります。
        </p>
        <p class="top-basic-design-description">
          基本設計が崩れているために、うまく成果が上がらない。<br
          />そうしたケースは少なくありません。
        </p>
        <p class="top-basic-design-description">
          基本が整っていないと、後から施策を重ねれば重ねるほど、ほころびが大きくなります。<br
          />だからこそ、作る前の設計が重要になります。
        </p>
        <ul class="top-basic-design-list">
          <li class="top-basic-design-item">
            <div class="top-basic-design-title-lv3">
              <span class="top-basic-design-title-number">01</span>
              <h3 class="top-basic-design-title-text">情報設計</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="top-basic-design-text">
              良質なコンテンツの土台となる情報設計を行います
            </p>
            <div class="top-basic-design-text-list-green-line">
              <ul class="c-list-green-line">
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">誰に届けるかを整理します</li>
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  何を載せるかを取捨選択します
                </li>
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  強みが伝わる言葉に整えます
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="top-basic-design-item">
            <div class="top-basic-design-title-lv3">
              <span class="top-basic-design-title-number">02</span>
              <h3 class="top-basic-design-title-text">導線設計</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="top-basic-design-text">
              ユーザーが迷わず行動できる導線を設計します
            </p>
            <div class="top-basic-design-text-list-green-line">
              <ul class="c-list-green-line">
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  読みやすい順番でコンテンツを構成します
                </li>
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  問い合わせ・予約につながる導線を整えます
                </li>
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  スマートフォンでも迷わず使えるよう設計します
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="top-basic-design-item">
            <div class="top-basic-design-title-lv3">
              <span class="top-basic-design-title-number">03</span>
              <h3 class="top-basic-design-title-text">運用設計</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="top-basic-design-text">
              公開後の運用と改善を見据えた設計を行います
            </p>
            <div class="top-basic-design-text-list-green-line">
              <ul class="c-list-green-line">
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  更新しやすい構成で制作します
                </li>
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  公開後の改善も見据えて設計します
                </li>
                <li class="c-list-green-line-item">
                  集客施策との連携も考えます
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body-top -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section-top -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../../styles/breakpoints" as *;

  .top-basic-design-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .top-basic-design-description {
    margin-block-start: 16px;

    & + & {
      margin-block-start: 8px;
    }
  }

  .top-basic-design-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: calc(40px + 16px);
    padding: 0;
    margin-block-start: calc(48px + 16px);
  }

  .top-basic-design-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-block: calc(32px + 16px) 32px;
    padding-inline: 32px;
    background-color: #f7f7f6;
    position: relative;
  }

  .top-basic-design-title-lv3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    line-height: 1;
    position: absolute;
    top: -16px;
    left: 0;
  }

  .top-basic-design-title-number {
    margin-block-end: 2px;
    color: var(--color-main);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .top-basic-design-title-text {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .top-basic-design-text {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .top-basic-design-text-list-green-line {
    margin-block-start: 16px;
  }

  @include mq() {
    .top-basic-design-lead {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .top-basic-design-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: calc(40px + 16px) 40px;
      margin-block-start: calc(40px + 16px);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .top-basic-design-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: min(56px, calc(56 / var(--width-pc) * 100vw));
    }
  }
</style>
